V3/v3+ select epochs16/14,with validation mean IoU.381906/.504644.
Test pixel accuracies are.822856/.849108,but mean IoU is only.403804/
.446050. Circle IoU remains.154771/.194559. The low-resolution examples
still confuse classes despite falling fitting loss;the decoder does not
remove these limitations in this bounded fit.

