\alttext(Row-normalized percentages with true classes as rows and predicted classes as columns.)


> Conclusion

Global-mean derivative checks and full v3/v3+ graphs precede compact whole-model fitting. Actual image/mask predictions,fit-only class weights and paired BN restoration expose the measured behavior without an Xception or benchmark-performance claim.

> References

- [Chen et al.(2017), Rethinking Atrous Convolution for Semantic Image Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1706.05587).
- [Chen et al.(2018), Encoder-Decoder with Atrous Separable Convolution for Semantic Image Segmentation](https://arxiv.org/abs/1802.02611).
